LEX Time Lock

"Payer" is a person.
"Receiver" is a person.
"Unlock Time" is a time.
"Alternate Unlock Time" is a time.

The Payer pays an amount into escrow, appoints the Receiver, fixes the Unlock Time, and fixes the Alternate Unlock Time.

CLAUSE: Draw.
The Receiver may, after the Unlock Time has passed and the Alternate Unlock Time has passed, pay the escrow to themselves.
